<title>SINGAPORE: GP Batteries interim profit up 14.3 pct.</title>
<headline>GP Batteries interim profit up 14.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 12.78     vs	11.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  4.50     vs	 4.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		16.01     vs	14.05</p>
<p>    Turnover			  172.59     vs     153.04</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest   1.39     vs	 0.93</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		3.83     vs	 3.41</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	  8.18     vs	 7.17</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	 0.70     vs	 0.15</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   13.22     vs	12.10</p>
</text>
